Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling, Darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sailing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,on the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,cobalt blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The clouds float above the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanging out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,just me and you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Our time is now and soon you'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile with all your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,As you go past the\Nproblems that await you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your hopes alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Never look down upon yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just cast a magic spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.12,0:00:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You will get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Twinkle, twinkle, rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fast, bleeds, premonitions!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.86,0:00:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the colors!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:00:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,From all the rainbow beams!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy Crazy Rainbow Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me and we'll go far!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just fallen angels!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.06,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shooting arrows into our hopeful dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dally, Dally!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.84,0:01:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy Crazy Rainbow Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.40,0:01:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a Crazy Rainbow Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Twinkle, twinkle, rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Within the cobalt blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven colors will come to our surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Twinkle, twinkle, rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon all your worries!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your troubles show through\Nthe mirror of your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me comfort you, my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold your time within my glove!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We sure are fallen angels!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just singing our hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All out from up above!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dying, dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.06,0:02:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to take it, I'll\Ngive it to you for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This year's Aqua Laguna did\Na real number on the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's giving it their best, but I\Ndon't think we can repair this on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Polly from Doc Blonde!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.56,0:03:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here in the back streets?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to work, Doc Clay! Now move!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Doc 3, I'm leaving this\Nside of the bridge to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.20,0:03:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Doc 5, you get started with the\Nhouses next to Scrap Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we still gotta do our day jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.18,0:03:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but I wanna see this whole town in\Ntip-top shape by the end of the month!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you, Galley-La!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They never let us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.96,0:04:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Building stuff sure is hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit we're a lot\Nbetter at breaking things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we're sleeping outdoors again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.08,0:04:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little rest and\Nyou'll be better in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Reindeer said Gamora's eyesight should\Nreturn if he takes it easy for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let us meet the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.66,0:04:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to apologize for\Ntreating them so bad before!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.49,0:04:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats aren't\Nmeeting with anyone today!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Our company prepared\Nthem a thank you package.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,At least let us give it to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with one or seven nudes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I please get a comment with\Nthe heroes who saved the mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No means no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They're busy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.98,0:04:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,At least let me take a picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the secretary to replace Polly Puff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm highly qualified!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop keeping the pirates to yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,awesome now that's what i call power\Nis this where you wanted it yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,that's perfect thanks wish we had you\Nguys around all the time this kind
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,of stuff is a piece of cake if you\Ngot more than bring it on you're
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,making everyone else look bad guys
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,by the way sniper king you sure you're
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If our bosses are still fighting\Nlike you said they were,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no point in us joining up\Nwith them until it's all settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.32,0:05:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll stick around here and\Nhelp out while they need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but after that we plan\Nto head back to Elbath.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long story short, you want\Nto come along with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.98,0:05:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I see so in the end you\Nburned the blueprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's better that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made yourself an\Nenemy of the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Spell it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.45,0:06:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you so busy\Ndrawing over there, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna was powerful this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's weighing\Non everyone's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It may not be long before this island\Nis completely swallowed by the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make this city float.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna make Water 7 a boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think that's even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We grew up watching a man who\Ncould make the impossible possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're a man, show some gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He did always do everything\Nwith a bang, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.00,0:06:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that you, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.90,0:06:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Ambi. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It finally came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.70,0:06:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're picking it up here at\Nthe train station as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your 200 million buried treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is gonna be sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope everyone's decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Kokoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.28,0:07:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, we're coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.90,0:07:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you better wait outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.26,0:07:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You boys have been sleeping for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have been awfully pooped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I blame you\Nafter all that fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.84,0:07:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirate King is back on his feet, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, actually not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though he couldn't\Nmove after the last fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,he didn't want to miss dinner\Nbecause he was sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So he developed the sleep\Neating technique you see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's so cool! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.62,0:08:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you call multi-talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, your Log Pose should be\Nset after another two or three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.56,0:08:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the Log Pose is set, it's not\Nlike we can go anywhere without a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All the money we saved up to\Nbuy a new ship is gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our clothes, furniture, even Bellemere's\Nprecious tangerine trees were lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna carried it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even move we left our stuff\Nin one of the backstreet hotels
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what your guests\Nare here about I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about kicking you out, but we\Nthought you tried to assassinate Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We treated your belongings as pirate loot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.26,0:08:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So we confiscated everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.90,0:09:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi! Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper reporting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.09,0:09:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm great, now that you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a heavy bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I treated the Franky family's wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't let Robin out of\Nmy sight for a single second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.78,0:09:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you,\NI'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.28,0:09:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my word, soldier. Guys, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.70,0:09:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My tangerine trees are okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we got our money\Nback and our stuff, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we buy a ship, then\Nwe'll be good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.53,0:09:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, baby, you guys\Nfeeling super? Oh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, some folks aren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the big entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Something going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Better listen close, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So, there's this island\Nthat's always at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.56,0:10:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, stop, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're here to tell bedtime\Nstories, go bother someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, this is important, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.08,0:10:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For years, fire has rained on that island.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.10,0:10:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Death and destruction are the\Nonly things that its people know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Houses burn down, cities fall to ruin,\Nthere's no place to run from all the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.78,0:10:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the midst of all this\Nmadness, there's a single tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, it never falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And no matter how much\Nthe island is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,its people gather around it\Nand build it all up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the strongest tree in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as anyone knows, only a few exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's known as the jewel tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.18,0:10:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Adam, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.70,0:10:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Every so often a piece of wood from\Nthat tree shows up on the black market
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've wanted one for a long time now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.16,0:10:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but the going price is two\Nhundred million berries,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.24,0:10:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,too expensive for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That is,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,until a bunch of pirates\Nshowed up flailing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,their money around and\Nbegging me to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.50,0:11:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.41,0:11:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You use our money to buy some stupid\Nlog and then you brag about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A long time ago, I decided that I was done\Nbuilding ships for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, I couldn't help but follow\Nin the footsteps of my old master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon enough, I found\Nmyself designing a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.76,0:11:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my hope is to use that\Nspecial wood to build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,to put all my heart into one last ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A ship of dreams that\Ncan sail across any sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had the blueprints for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I finally have the wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.46,0:12:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left is to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what I'm saying here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.98,0:12:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it would be my honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,if you'd take my ship and sail the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna give us\Nthe ship free of charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, because that way I'll know\Nmy masterpiece is in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, that's all I could ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.44,0:12:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that and you kind\Nof paid for it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger is the only man in history\Nwho's sailed across the whole world,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and his ship, the Otto Jackson,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,was made from a jewel tree as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.20,0:12:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, I'll show you the\Nbest damn ship you've ever seen. Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you're a ship right after all you can\Npretend all you like but in the end
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.60,0:12:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you're just like old Tom ain't ya
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,guess you're right
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:13:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now it took
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,a while but I I think I finally understand\Nthe pride Tom felt when he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Franky! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.16,0:13:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be happy to take your show!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now on to the next island! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a new show! Get him! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think those bastards\Nwould come after us so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I bet Luffy's\Nstill sleeping, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I got to warn him before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here to arrest the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after they saved the mayor's\Nlife, they won't show them any mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you see that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Vice Admiral Garp's ship,\Nstraight from headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, did you say Garp?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The same Garp that nearly\Ncaptured Gold Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Over and over again, he's a living legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If they send him, if they don't\Nrun, those pirates are finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me this is the same beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this crap right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.76,0:14:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, hold on, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The only person here is our president, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Toobin, I know you're\Nhiding those pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.24,0:14:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.78,0:14:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.69,0:14:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you two. Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.52,0:15:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.24,0:15:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.54,0:15:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but are you\Nfolks the Straw Hat Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I have some friends here that\Nwould like to share our word with Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.16,0:15:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.07,0:15:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.88,0:15:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would one little\Npunch hurt you so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're made of rubber!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because there is no\Ndefense against a fist of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been getting in a lot\Nof trouble lately, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.46,0:15:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.20,0:16:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you owe me an apology, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But isn't that the name of the Navy\Nhero that fought against Gold Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.84,0:16:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, is this Navy guy\Nreally your grandpa? Sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, don't try to fight him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll kill you just like he almost killed\Nme over and over when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.60,0:16:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, you're gonna\Ngive them the wrong idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,although I admit I did throw\Nyou into a ravine that one time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and I left you in the\Njungle a few times too,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and sure there were those times I\Nsent you sailing on those balloons,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't do it to kill you,\NI did it to make you a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is where all of\NLuffy's endurance comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why everything\Nrolls off of him when
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.00,0:17:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I left you and Ace with\Nmy friend for training.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought everything would work out fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.06,0:17:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but I turned my back
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and you end up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.46,0:17:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to make you into a navy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You stinking ingrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How the heck did you become a criminal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.50,0:17:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.40,0:17:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault you wouldn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all that damn redhead's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.94,0:17:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The fool. I.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't even be alive\Nif it wasn't for Sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.34,0:17:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.26,0:17:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that any way to speak to your grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all set for!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A captain's been captured by the Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.54,0:17:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:17:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! No! This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:17:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try to help Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.02,0:18:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,then all those Marines outside are\Ngoing to rush in and attack us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're asleep?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So wait, what are we supposed to do here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been in a\Nsituation like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, did I fall asleep again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.16,0:18:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up and take your lecture like a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare go off on\Nme when I'm yelling at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's no wonder Luffy\Nnever talked about his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.60,0:18:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of that red-headed\Npirate friend of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:19:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,do you have any clue what kind of\Ndangerous business he's involved in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't heard anything\Nabout Shanks in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he okay? What's he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he okay? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's as many pirates out there\Nas there are stars in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.60,0:19:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But that redhead's one of the brightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in the same class\Nas Whitebeard, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only four pirates\Nas powerful as that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.32,0:19:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and they rule over the second half\Nof the Grand Line, like kings!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the four emperors!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The seven warlords and us folks of\Nthe navy have allied against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The idea is to create a balance of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If any one of these three forces\Ngrew stronger than the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.60,0:19:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,then the peace we worked so hard to\Nprotect would come crumbling down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it,\Nbut I'm glad he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, brings back memories, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.74,0:19:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy has connections\Nto red-haired Shanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.68,0:19:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where he got his Straw Hat from.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.18,0:19:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanks asked him to take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.52,0:20:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea he was such\Nan important guy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over here, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, we're too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.90,0:20:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, good luck with the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.80,0:20:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't have tried to mug you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.94,0:20:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for showing me the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.74,0:20:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.14,0:20:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the pirate hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.58,0:20:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems to be going on\Nsome sort of rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.78,0:20:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's from Luffy's crew, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.88,0:20:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him hell, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cookery knives, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting choice of a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got there
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.24,0:21:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.04,0:21:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as tough as I thought you'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a nice one, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I give...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Luffy. Hi, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.44,0:21:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.78,0:21:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's me. It's Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.76,0:21:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you don't remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kobe, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.18,0:21:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I do have a friend named Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Kobe I know is a\Nwhole lot smaller than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.40,0:22:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, that's the right Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.36,0:22:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The crybaby, good-for-nothing\NKobe from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.54,0:22:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.72,0:22:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.40,0:22:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But why is he on the Grand Line?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.32,0:22:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm not a\Ncommissioned Navy officer yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.24,0:22:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I heard you\Nguys were in the area,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to stop by and say hello\Nwhile I still had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.50,0:22:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for you two, we\Nwouldn't be where we are today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.15,0:22:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't go quite that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of stuff happened,\Nbut long story short,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.40,0:22:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,we ended up being trained by\NVice Admiral Garp himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.32,0:22:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have been hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you grew so much from before,\NI didn't even recognize you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.42,0:22:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.78,0:22:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kobe I remember was\Na pudgy little dorky guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.14,0:22:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're worn out\Nafter all that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.58,0:22:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.49,0:22:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.66,0:22:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you in ages!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.32,0:22:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.28,0:23:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.00,0:23:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't recognize me at all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me! See? Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.00,0:23:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't see. Just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.90,0:23:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a clue, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.70,0:23:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Helmepo, Captain\NMorgan's son, Helmepo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.30,0:23:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I had you tied up you were almost\Nexecuted because of me Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.02,0:23:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't possibly\Nforget that could you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.68,0:23:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.96,0:23:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop giving me such a hard time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.80,0:23:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No one likes a bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.06,0:23:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro you seem to be handling\Nthis well, don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.48,0:23:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.84,0:23:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.70,0:23:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I made empty threats?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.00,0:23:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was always talking about my daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.82,0:23:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.92,0:24:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.64,0:24:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.82,0:24:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.16,0:24:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.14,0:24:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to forgive\Nthem, but I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.98,0:24:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Koby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.62,0:24:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have to accept the\Npast and move on, Helmepo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.76,0:24:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He still sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.04,0:24:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.50,0:24:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I've got a job for\Nyou boys. Sir! This wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.92,0:24:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fix it. What? Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.26,0:24:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were going to have us fix it,\Nwhy'd you break it in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.90,0:24:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Because walking through a door\Ndoesn't make much of an impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The only impression you're\Nmaking here is a bad one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.56,0:24:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll fix the wall, but it's\Nyour fault, so you've got to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.72,0:24:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.14,0:24:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.40,0:24:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So this grandpa of yours\Nis really famous. Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.88,0:24:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I never really asked him about his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.78,0:24:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Luffy, I heard you met\Nyour old man a while back. Huh? My dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.88,0:24:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.64,0:24:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even think I had a dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.28,0:25:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.66,0:25:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he'd introduce himself to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.56,0:25:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I hear, he saw\Nyou off back at Loguetown.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.10,0:25:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember what happened, but I\Nsure don't remember Luffy's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.94,0:25:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, could you give me a hint here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.98,0:25:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's dad like?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.82,0:25:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of your father is Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.86,0:25:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon, the revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.98,0:25:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.04,0:25:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.50,0:25:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The revolutionary has a son?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.44,0:25:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though he's famous,\NLuffy didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.14,0:25:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Dragon is Vice Admiral Garp's son?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.98,0:25:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of crazy messed\Nup family have they got?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.04,0:25:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I never\Nheard Dragon's full name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.42,0:25:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.92,0:25:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everyone freaking out so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.80,0:25:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.72,0:25:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to tell me you've\Nnever heard of Dragon before?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.80,0:26:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a dangerous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.56,0:26:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, really dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.46,0:26:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.50,0:26:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly sure how\NI should explain this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.66,0:26:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates like us are\Nenemies with the navy but.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.92,0:26:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't usually attack them on\Nour own but there is one group
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.48,0:26:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,that is directly opposing the\Nauthority of the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.12,0:26:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The revolutionary army and the man\Nat the head of that group is Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.70,0:26:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,By now his ideology has spread to many\Nnations causing worldwide rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.14,0:26:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The government's hold has already\Ncollapsed in a number of regions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.48,0:26:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, the government is furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.86,0:26:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They've labeled Dragon as\Nthe world's worst criminal
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.18,0:26:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and will stop at absolutely\Nnothing to hunt him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.78,0:26:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is that no one\Nknows a single thing about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.08,0:26:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's very mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.86,0:26:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.90,0:26:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.90,0:26:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, that was a mistake, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.44,0:27:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I probably shouldn't\Nhave said all that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.50,0:27:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.32,0:27:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.04,0:27:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
